         ],
         "note": "stamped, no separators; all five figures plain, the last with a single counter so a 6. Parsed 25.1.26 on the pattern of 14114 = 14.1.1914; 25.12.6 would need a one-figure year. The same two horizontal strokes and comma-like mark stand to the left of the figures as on sx275gw8801, so they seem to belong to the stamp."
        }
       ]
